      ],
      "source": "https://www.achp.gov/preserve-america/community/douglas-michigan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The town once thrived on peach orchards, a basket factory, and as a Lake Michigan port for boat traffic.",
